Relevant tables & columns  
• GOOGLE_ADS.GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER.REMOVED_CREATIVE_STATS  
  – "creative_page_url" : page URL of each removed ad  
  – "region_stats" (VARIANT) : contains “region_code”, “first_shown”, “last_shown”, “times_shown_lower_bound”, “times_shown_upper_bound”, “times_shown_availability_date”, … – used for HR filtering and impression‑range checks  
  – "disapproval" (VARIANT) : nested object that stores “removal_reason”, “violation_category”, …  
  – "audience_selection_approach_info" (VARIANT) : for demographic_info, geo_location, contextual_signals, customer_lists, topics_of_interest – used to be sure at least one is not “NOT_USED” (or similar)  

Principal conditions we will need later  
• rs.value:"region_code" = 'HR'  
• rs.value:"times_shown_availability_date" IS NULL  
• rs.value:"times_shown_lower_bound"::INT  > 10000  
• rs.value:"times_shown_upper_bound"::INT  < 25000  
• At least one of these is not “CRITERIA_NOT_USED” (or “NONE”) → audience_selection_approach_info:"demographic_info", ...  

Below are ten exploratory‑to‑final Snowflake SQL queries (each limited to 20 rows) that progressively inspect the data and finally satisfy all requested filters.  
All column names are enclosed in double quotes.

```sql
-- 1. Description: Quick look at a handful of rows in the removed‑creatives table
SELECT *
FROM "GOOGLE_ADS"."GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER"."REMOVED_CREATIVE_STATS"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2. Description: Flatten region_stats to see the keys that exist inside each object
SELECT r."creative_page_url",
       rs.value
FROM   "GOOGLE_ADS"."GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER"."REMOVED_CREATIVE_STATS"  r,
       LATERAL FLATTEN(input => r."region_stats") rs
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3. Description: Show only Croatian (“HR”) region‑level statistics
SELECT r."creative_page_url",
       rs.value:"region_code"::STRING                          AS "region_code",
       rs.value:"first_shown"::STRING                          AS "first_shown",
       rs.value:"last_shown"::STRING                           AS "last_shown",
       rs.value:"times_shown_lower_bound"::INT                 AS "lower_bound",
       rs.value:"times_shown_upper_bound"::INT                 AS "upper_bound"
FROM   "GOOGLE_ADS"."GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER"."REMOVED_CREATIVE_STATS"  r,
       LATERAL FLATTEN(input => r."region_stats") rs
WHERE  rs.value:"region_code"::STRING = 'HR'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4. Description: Add the condition that times_shown_availability_date is NULL (missing)
SELECT r."creative_page_url",
       rs.value:"region_code"::STRING              AS "region_code",
       rs.value:"times_shown_availability_date"    AS "ts_avail_date"
FROM   "GOOGLE_ADS"."GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER"."REMOVED_CREATIVE_STATS" r,
       LATERAL FLATTEN(input => r."region_stats") rs
WHERE  rs.value:"region_code"::STRING = 'HR'
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_availability_date" IS NULL
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5. Description: Impose impression‑range limits (lower > 10 000 ; upper < 25 000)
SELECT r."creative_page_url",
       rs.value:"first_shown"::STRING               AS "first_shown",
       rs.value:"last_shown"::STRING                AS "last_shown",
       rs.value:"times_shown_lower_bound"::INT      AS "lower_bound",
       rs.value:"times_shown_upper_bound"::INT      AS "upper_bound"
FROM   "GOOGLE_ADS"."GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER"."REMOVED_CREATIVE_STATS" r,
       LATERAL FLATTEN(input => r."region_stats") rs
WHERE  rs.value:"region_code"::STRING             = 'HR'
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_availability_date"   IS NULL
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_lower_bound"::INT   > 10000
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_upper_bound"::INT   < 25000
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6. Description: Inspect the audience_selection_approach_info blob for those candidate creatives
SELECT DISTINCT r."creative_page_url",
       r."audience_selection_approach_info"
FROM   "GOOGLE_ADS"."GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER"."REMOVED_CREATIVE_STATS" r,
       LATERAL FLATTEN(input => r."region_stats") rs
WHERE  rs.value:"region_code"::STRING             = 'HR'
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_availability_date"   IS NULL
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_lower_bound"::INT   > 10000
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_upper_bound"::INT   < 25000
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7. Description: Filter so that at least one approach is not marked as NOT_USED / NONE
SELECT DISTINCT r."creative_page_url"
FROM   "GOOGLE_ADS"."GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER"."REMOVED_CREATIVE_STATS" r,
       LATERAL FLATTEN(input => r."region_stats") rs
WHERE  rs.value:"region_code"::STRING             = 'HR'
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_availability_date"   IS NULL
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_lower_bound"::INT   > 10000
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_upper_bound"::INT   < 25000
  AND (
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"demographic_info"::STRING ,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')     NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'  OR
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"geo_location"::STRING    ,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')     NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'  OR
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"contextual_signals"::STRING,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')   NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'  OR
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"customer_lists"::STRING  ,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')     NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'  OR
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"topics_of_interest"::STRING,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')  NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'
      )
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8. Description: Examine the disapproval object (removal reason & violation category) for those filtered ads
SELECT r."creative_page_url",
       d.value:"removal_reason"::STRING     AS "removal_reason",
       d.value:"violation_category"::STRING AS "violation_category"
FROM   "GOOGLE_ADS"."GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER"."REMOVED_CREATIVE_STATS" r,
       LATERAL FLATTEN(input => r."region_stats") rs,
       LATERAL FLATTEN(input => r."disapproval")  d
WHERE  rs.value:"region_code"::STRING = 'HR'
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_availability_date" IS NULL
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_lower_bound"::INT  > 10000
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_upper_bound"::INT  < 25000
  AND (
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"demographic_info"::STRING ,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')     NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'  OR
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"geo_location"::STRING    ,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')     NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'  OR
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"contextual_signals"::STRING,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')   NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'  OR
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"customer_lists"::STRING  ,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')     NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'  OR
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"topics_of_interest"::STRING,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')  NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'
      )
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9. Description: Pull everything we ultimately need; still without the “five most recent” limitation
SELECT r."creative_page_url",
       rs.value:"first_shown"::STRING                    AS "first_shown",
       rs.value:"last_shown"::STRING                     AS "last_shown",
       d.value:"removal_reason"::STRING                  AS "removal_reason",
       d.value:"violation_category"::STRING              AS "violation_category",
       rs.value:"times_shown_lower_bound"::INT           AS "lower_bound",
       rs.value:"times_shown_upper_bound"::INT           AS "upper_bound"
FROM   "GOOGLE_ADS"."GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER"."REMOVED_CREATIVE_STATS" r,
       LATERAL FLATTEN(input => r."region_stats") rs,
       LATERAL FLATTEN(input => r."disapproval")  d
WHERE  rs.value:"region_code"::STRING = 'HR'
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_availability_date" IS NULL
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_lower_bound"::INT  > 10000
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_upper_bound"::INT  < 25000
  AND (
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"demographic_info"::STRING ,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')     NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'  OR
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"geo_location"::STRING    ,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')     NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'  OR
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"contextual_signals"::STRING,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')   NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'  OR
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"customer_lists"::STRING  ,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')     NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'  OR
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"topics_of_interest"::STRING,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')  NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'
      )
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 10. Description: FINAL query – deliver the five most recently shown (by last_shown desc) that meet ALL required criteria
SELECT r."creative_page_url"                                                      AS "page_url",
       rs.value:"first_shown"::STRING                                             AS "first_shown",
       rs.value:"last_shown"::STRING                                              AS "last_shown",
       d.value:"removal_reason"::STRING                                           AS "removal_reason",
       d.value:"violation_category"::STRING                                       AS "violation_category",
       rs.value:"times_shown_lower_bound"::INT                                    AS "times_shown_lower_bound",
       rs.value:"times_shown_upper_bound"::INT                                    AS "times_shown_upper_bound"
FROM   "GOOGLE_ADS"."GOOGLE_ADS_TRANSPARENCY_CENTER"."REMOVED_CREATIVE_STATS" r
       , LATERAL FLATTEN(input => r."region_stats") rs
       , LATERAL FLATTEN(input => r."disapproval")  d
WHERE  rs.value:"region_code"::STRING = 'HR'
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_availability_date" IS NULL
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_lower_bound"::INT  > 10000
  AND  rs.value:"times_shown_upper_bound"::INT  < 25000
  AND (
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"demographic_info"::STRING ,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')     NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'  OR
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"geo_location"::STRING    ,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')     NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'  OR
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"contextual_signals"::STRING,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')   NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'  OR
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"customer_lists"::STRING  ,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')     NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'  OR
        COALESCE(r."audience_selection_approach_info":"topics_of_interest"::STRING,'CRITERIA_NOT_USED')  NOT ILIKE '%NOT_USED%'
      )
ORDER BY rs.value:"last_shown"::DATE DESC
LIMIT 5;
```

